  "details": "- Rebase onto the vendor 3.1.1-3.el9_8.5 source RPM, which fixes\n  CVE-2026-59982, CVE-2026-59184, CVE-2026-59189, CVE-2026-59981 and\n  CVE-2026-34544\n- Retain the TuxCare fixes absent from the vendor build: 64-bit pixel\n  count, width and base offset arithmetic in exrmultipart convert(); the\n  OpenEXRCore chunk.c and parse_header.c short-read and chunk-size\n  hardening; rejection of IDManifest variable-length integers whose shift\n  reaches 64 bits; and the dataWindow().min.y row mapping plus bounds\n  checks in SampleCountChannel::set()",
